# Force LF line endings repo-wide. This project is developed on a Windows
# machine but built/run through WSL and Docker (Linux-only tooling), and
# Windows git's core.autocrlf silently reintroducing CRLF breaks shell
# script shebangs and causes Windows-git/WSL-git to disagree about what's
# "clean" (git submodule/forge install operations refuse to run against a
# dirty tree caused entirely by line-ending drift, not real changes).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files — never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
